OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, will spread northeast this
OL,7,Fmorning, but drier in the northeast.
OL,8,FCloudy this afternoon with rain, this
OL,9,Fclearing from the west later. Strong
OL,10,Fto gale southerly winds in the
OL,11,Fnorthwest at first.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThis evening will be partly
OL,14,Fcloudy with a few showers. The rest of
OL,15,Fthe night will see clear periods with
OL,16,Fa few showers in the west, drier
OL,17,Felsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
