OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FSome sunny intervals and
OL,6,Fscattered showers in the morning,
OL,7,Fthese mainly in the west. Becoming
OL,8,Flargely dry in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,11,Fdry and increasingly windy on Tuesday
OL,12,Fwith strong southeasterly winds. Early
OL,13,Fwind and rain on Wednesday followed by
OL,14,Fa few showers. Bright with a few
OL,15,Fshowers on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
